Raspberry Pi UPS Plus Demo Code (Intermediate - Functional)

This script demonstrates the UPS Plus module's functionalities using a functional programming style.
It reads various parameters such as voltage, current, temperature, and power status
from both the Raspberry Pi side and the battery side. It also showcases how to set
certain parameters like protection voltage, sampling period, and shutdown countdown.

Advanced users can customize and develop this code to meet their specific needs.
